- **Never pool strategy tags.** Per-tag analysis only.
- **Never reconstruct a file from memory** — always work from the current paste.
- **Check the sign convention before interpreting any bias number.**
- **Distinguish the MARKET's top bracket from the MODEL's pick.** They are
  different populations and conflating them produces opposite conclusions.
